      "updated": 1776498809811,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Funcational Requirements \n    -> 1. store data . \n    -> 2. visible in app \n    -> 3. download data.\n    -> 4. file shareing and sync.\nNon Funcational Requirement \n    1. High avaliable (customer can access data when ever )\n    2. Eventual consitient\n    3. High size upload and downloads.\n    4. Secure\n    5. 50  GB Files \n\n\n\n\n ",
      "fontSize": 36.01302083333336,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Funcational Requirements \n    -> 1. store data . \n    -> 2. visible in app \n    -> 3. download data.\n    -> 4. file shareing and sync.\nNon Funcational Requirement \n    1. High avaliable (customer can access data when ever )\n    2. Eventual consitient\n    3. High size upload and downloads.\n    4. Secure\n    5. 50  GB Files \n\n\n\n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
